      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُهَبَّجٌ</span></b>  A man <i>swollen;</i> or <i>affected with a tumour.</i> (TA.) A <i>swollen</i> face of a man; (A;)
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَبِجٌ</span></b> , (L,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُتَهَبِّج</span></b> . (A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  A man
<i>heavy,</i> or <i>dull, in spirit;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثقِيلُ النَّفْسِ</span>.
